Package: huebox
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Terminal theme editor with live preview
 huebox shows the colours your terminal is actually using and lets you
 change them from a keyboard-driven interface — no hex codes,
 no hand-editing, no restarting.
